This supplement provides numerical breakdowns, statistical details, and additional visualizations for the main article. The controlled Unity evaluations use the complete 64,440-sequence test index and the stated frozen checkpoint. Errors use dataset coordinate units under the archived batch-referenced transformation. The scopes and denominators specific to each experiment are stated below.

